    "description": "Features of Mirror app:\r\n- Use the front or back camera as a mirror, necessary when you go to the party\r\n- When you use the front camera, the application will support the light by the screen for you to use in the dark\r\n- You can customize the lighting color when using the front camera. This is very useful because when you use the mirror to use yellow to look better\r\n- Photo gallery will manage the pictures you take\r\n- Image zoom feature helps you see the smallest details\r\n- Convenient quick key helps you open mirror app every time",
